  "summary": "<p>National Rural Health Day honors the people who keep rural America strong. As our nation celebrates Rural Health Day, Americans across the country are benefiting from President Trump&#8217;s leadership, which has delivered the single largest investment in rural health in American history. The landmark $50 billion Rural Health Transformation Fund—which every single Democrat voted AGAINST—is [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/national-rural-health-day-president-trump-delivers-largest-rural-health-investment-in-history/\">NATIONAL RURAL HEALTH DAY: President Trump Delivers Largest Rural Health Investment in History</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
