t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1189\" height=\"472\" src=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-19-173558.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-55022\" srcset=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-19-173558.png 1189w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-19-173558.png?resize=600,238 600w, https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-19-173558.png?resize=768,305 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1189px) 100vw, 1189px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><em><strong>National Rural Health Day honors the people who keep rural America strong.</strong></em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As our nation celebrates <a href=\"https://x.com/SecKennedy/status/2123505828095218168?a=HoPXj6rbIcOYOZrjyN8&amp;s=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rural Health Day</a>, Americans across the country are benefiting from President Trump&#8217;s leadership, which has delivered the single largest investment in rural health in American history. The landmark $50 billion Rural Health Transformation Fund—which every single Democrat voted AGAINST—is already working to improve healthcare across all 50 states. These funds are <a href=\"https://nbcmontana.com/news/local/trump-administration-to-invest-87m-in-montana-rural-ems-ambulances-equipment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">expanding</a><a href=\"https://www.unr.edu/nevada-today/news/2026/nevada-rural-health-transformation-program\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> </a>workforce programs in rural America, promoting access to <a href=\"https://www.cbsnews.com/atlanta/news/millions-headed-to-rural-georgia-hospitals-for-telehealth-staff-and-new-technology/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">telemedicine</a>, and helping <a href=\"https://www.wbiw.com/2026/09/03/trump-administration-announces-120-million-to-expand-maternal-and-infant-health-services-increase-primary-care-access-and-grow-the-healthcare-workforce-across-indiana/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">upgrade</a> rural hospitals, <a href=\"https://www.medicaid.gov/resources-for-states/rural-health\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">among numerous other initiatives</a>.  </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Trump Administration is also relentlessly working to lower costs and strengthen the healthcare system for all Americans. President Trump’s efforts to ensure Americans get the same low prices available in other countries for prescription drugs have delivered <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/08/president-trump-delivers-largest-prescription-drug-price-drop-in-over-60-years/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">the largest drop in drug prices in OVER 60 years</a>; made weight loss medicines available to seniors for just <a href=\"https://www.cms.gov/newsroom/press-releases/cms-launches-medicare-glp-1-bridge-expanding-access-glp-1-medications\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">$50 per month</a>; and has secured more than <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/business/healthcare-pharmaceuticals/global-drugmakers-rush-boost-us-presence-tariff-threat-looms-2026-10-06/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">$500 billion in investments</a> to reshore innovative pharmaceutical development, creating jobs and opportunity for hardworking Americans.  </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In today’s <em>RealClearHealth</em>, Health and Human Services Secretary Robert F. Kennedy Jr., CMS Administrator Dr. Mehmet Oz, and HRSA Administrator Thomas Engels highlighted how President Donald J. Trump is delivering on his promise to put rural America first by transforming rural healthcare.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Read the full op-ed <a href=\"https://www.realclearhealth.com/articles/2026/11/19/president_trump_is_delivering_for_rural_america_1217692.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/national-rural-health-day-president-trump-delivers-largest-rural-health-investment-in-history/\">NATIONAL RURAL HEALTH DAY: President Trump Delivers Largest Rural Health Investment in History</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
